{
    "title": "Subway Princess Runner",
    "description": "Subway Princess Runner is an endless running game. Rush as fast as you can dodge the oncoming trains, You can choose your favorite character to use the skateboard to surf in the subway. Help Lucy and  Kevin escape the police and earn high scores, what are you waiting for? Run now!!!\r\n\r\n[FEATURES]:\r\n- Subway theme game\r\n- Influent screen touch\r\n- Double tap for skateboard, feeling the special running\r\n- Challenge the highest score with world players\r\n- The higher the level,the higher the score\r\n- Grind trains with your cool crew\r\n- Colorful and vivid HD graphics\r\n- Upgrade all the properties to get endless power\r\n\r\n[HOW TO PLAY]:\r\n- Jump, slide to avoid obstacle\r\n- Smooth touch your phone\r\n- Run as far as possible to pick up coins and diamonds\r\n- Easy to run left or right \r\n- Use prop of scores, coins\r\n- Upgrade your level by notching tasks\r\n- Choose your liked characters\r\n\r\n[EVENTS]:\r\n- Daily Highscore, Challenge high scores to enter the rankings!\r\n- Crazy Runner, Challenge levels, accumulate points and win special characters!\r\n- Team Battle, Unlock more characters and get more exchange coins!\r\n\r\nRun as far as you can, Join the most daring chase!\r\n\r\nFOLLOW US\r\nIf you have any questions, please contact our Facebook Homepage: https://www.facebook.com/SubwayPrincessRunner",
    "descriptionHTML": "Subway Princess Runner is an endless running game. Rush as fast as you can dodge the oncoming trains, You can choose your favorite character to use the skateboard to surf in the subway. Help Lucy and  Kevin escape the police and earn high scores, what are you waiting for? Run now!!!<br><br>[FEATURES]:<br>- Subway theme game<br>- Influent screen touch<br>- Double tap for skateboard, feeling the special running<br>- Challenge the highest score with world players<br>- The higher the level,the higher the score<br>- Grind trains with your cool crew<br>- Colorful and vivid HD graphics<br>- Upgrade all the properties to get endless power<br><br>[HOW TO PLAY]:<br>- Jump, slide to avoid obstacle<br>- Smooth touch your phone<br>- Run as far as possible to pick up coins and diamonds<br>- Easy to run left or right <br>- Use prop of scores, coins<br>- Upgrade your level by notching tasks<br>- Choose your liked characters<br><br>[EVENTS]:<br>- Daily Highscore, Challenge high scores to enter the rankings!<br>- Crazy Runner, Challenge levels, accumulate points and win special characters!<br>- Team Battle, Unlock more characters and get more exchange coins!<br><br>Run as far as you can, Join the most daring chase!<br><br>FOLLOW US<br>If you have any questions, please contact our Facebook Homepage: https://www.facebook.com/SubwayPrincessRunner",
